Maintainer: Proxybarrio <proxybar@gmail.com>
Description: Nettalabbo - open source network laboratory for Ubuntu
 Nettalabbo is an experimental desktop toolkit for Xubuntu and other
 Ubuntu systems. It brings classic network diagnostics and alternative
 Internet protocols together in one retro-inspired, independent interface.
 .
 Check DNS, Ping and Trace; inspect domain registration through RDAP and
 WHOIS; scan ports; and examine mail routing and server connectivity.
 Connect to SSH or Telnet systems, or explore Gopher, Gemini and other
 alternative networks with clickable links, history and raw protocol views.
 .
 Created by Proxybarrio with AI-assisted development. MIT licensed.
 Active test release: incomplete features and bugs are expected.
 Bug reports and feedback are welcome on GitHub under Proxybarrio.
